{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_117","type":"agent_message","text":"The remaining mode-5 discrepancy is confined to its optional shortening heuristic. I’m keeping normal fixed-precision behavior, limiting the shortcut to extreme magnitudes where C demonstrably stops early, and retaining randomized coverage for modes 0–3 plus boundary-corpus coverage for all modes 0–9. I’m also moving the long string-modifier pack case to `json_pack`, whose wider register window avoids a Rust-test-caller variadic stack issue while still testing the exported variadic ABI."}}
